# Baylen, the Haymaker: "Tap three untapped tokens you control: Draw a card." Only untapped tokens its controller controls count:
# on turn 3 Bot1 has two Spirit tokens, a Memnite (a creature but not a token) and Bot2 has two Spirit tokens of its own, so
# neither the draw ability nor the four-token ability can be paid (nothing is tapped for a refused activation). After the
# flashback of Lingering Souls Bot1 has exactly four tokens: three are tapped to draw a card and the one left untapped cannot
# pay for another activation.

